This crate ships coordinate reference system data from the EPSG Geodetic
Parameter Registry:

- data/epsg.tsv holds EPSG v12.029 data. scripts/gen_epsg.py generates it
  from pyproj 3.8.0, which bundles PROJ 9.8.1.
- data/epsg_supplement.tsv holds EPSG change 2026.081 data (GDM2020, EPSG
  datum 1471, and its coordinate reference systems). It was entered from
  the EPSG Geodetic Parameter Registry API (https://apps.epsg.org/api/v1/).

Parameter values and formulas follow IOGP Guidance Note 7-2 and PROJ 9.8.1.
